  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f19df785-7d10-4b31-a2b2-3deb719ac409"],
 ", whose members are its monotone single-valued selections"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"a2f84af1-9175-4877-94fa-d110c456313b"],

