  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ac9e6cf0-c481-4c1e-b92e-ffb19140b007"],
 " of every event in the radar domain, with its time and distance marginals, \
its domain, the directed subgraph on the domain and the base graph on the \
coordinate cells"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"9d20edc5-2bf6-4c3e-a01c-a9ba613d3540"]
}, Open  ]],

